"115 Offline" = "115 离线";
"The system Settings app can only store the 115 Cookie in UserDefaults temporarily. When you return to JavDB, the plugin immediately moves it into the Keychain (ThisDeviceOnly) and deletes the plaintext. The text field will look empty afterwards; that does not mean the cookie was lost. It will not be written back to UserDefaults or logs. Use the floating-button panel to confirm. The folder CID is stored in UserDefaults (not a secret)." = "系统设置只能把 115 Cookie 临时写到 UserDefaults。回到 JavDB 后，插件会立即把它迁入本机钥匙串（ThisDeviceOnly）并删除明文。之后这个文本框可能是空的，不代表 Cookie 已丢失，也不会把完整 Cookie 写回 UserDefaults 或日志。请到浮钮面板确认。离线目录 CID 存在 UserDefaults（不是密钥）。";
"Cookie status" = "Cookie 状态";
